{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜司法及法律事務委員會討論司法人員薪酬調整等／博愛醫院中醫證電針可減輕耳鳴\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261026.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會司法及法律事務委員會今日(10月26日)開會討論司法效率以及司法人員薪酬調整。另外，博愛醫院中醫服務團隊聯同中大醫學院中醫學院，研究證實電針有效減輕耳鳴的困擾。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.507179+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T23:43:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T22:58:10.414200+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:00.645113+00:00","content_hash":"f15b1b53f5cc682a4b0fc8227507b6c40fa3090765b3ae162cacacda146ac44c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.507179+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}